  "question": {
    "text": "A curve is such that the slope of the tangent to it at any point <math><mi>P</mi></math> is the product of ordinate of <math><mi>P</mi></math> and abscissa increased by <math><mn>2.</mn></math>&nbsp;If it passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then its equation is"
